          "quote": "(comp (ref \"R23\") (value \"0\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"/NET0007\") (node (ref \"R23\") (pin \"1\")) (node (ref \"R8\") (pin \"1\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"/NET0011\") (node (ref \"R1\") (pin \"1\")) (node (ref \"R12\") (pin \"1\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "\"Short R10, R10 for Core2 and CoreS3 / Short R9, R11 for others\""
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The two distinct M5Stack GPIOs assigned as alternatives for each PWM channel are electrically shorted together. This can cause GPIO output contention and can prevent correct PWM operation on supported Core variants.",
      "confidence": 0.96
    }
  ],
  "summary": "An anomaly is present: the netlist connects both alternate GPIO mappings for each PWM channel through 0 Ω links, rather than selecting one mapping for the intended M5Stack Core variant."
}

